  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.3: a database is open in one XodContext at a time: keep one per database for the life of the application and dispose it; a second open, in this process or another, throws DatabaseLockedException (LockDatabase has no effect). A transaction changes no file before its commit, and a rollback touches none; a failed commit is undone even when another program holds one of its files. Matching by example is exact. Encrypted 1.x databases open with their password. Read https://xod.sabaeon.com/docs/upgrading before upgrading. All notes: https://github.com/mhsallam/xod/blob/main/docs/RELEASE-NOTES-2.0.3.md. XOD 2.0: a rework of the 2017 library. Versions before 2.0.0 (0.1.x and the 1.0.0 betas) were MIT; 2.0.0 is Apache-2.0. Migration guide from 1.x: https://github.com/mhsallam/xod/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION-GUIDE.md",
